{
  "name": "Generate AI captions and publish to every social media platform",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Generate AI captions and publish to every social media platform\n\n### How it works\n\n1. Runs when you click Execute Workflow.\n2. Sets the post topic and desired tone that guide the AI-written content.\n3. Uses OpenAI to write the post copy and parses it into per-platform fields.\n4. Publishes posts to Instagram, X (Twitter), LinkedIn, TikTok, Facebook, Pinterest, Bluesky, Mastodon, and Threads via the SocialRobot API.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- [ ] Install the SocialRobot community node and connect your SocialRobot API credential (API key: socialrobot.io, Scheduler -> API Keys).\n- [ ] In the Set post topic node, set the post topic and desired tone to your own content.\n- [ ] Select your connected SocialRobot account in each Publish node.\n- [ ] Set your Pinterest board ID in the Publish to Pinterest node.\n- [ ] Replace the sample media URL with your own public image or video URL.\n\n### Customization\n\nEdit the prompt in the AI Content Generator node, or change the OpenAI model, to tune the tone of the copy.",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 696
      },
      "id": "6dcda3fc-a46f-45d7-95b5-875a86fa2a12",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        40,
        40
      ]
    },
